# ThreadSanitizer suppressions (FA_SANITIZE=thread). Read through TSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=...
# Policy: a race in engine or tool code is fixed, never listed. Only races inside system libraries we do not build may be
# listed, each with its reason above it. Format: race:<function or library pattern>
#
# Mesa's llvmpipe (libgallium), the software GL driver of the headless CI runner: its worker threads lock a mutex that
# the driver itself destroys when a frame's resources are freed (pthread_mutex_destroy / pthread_cond_destroy against
# pthread_mutex_lock, every frame inside libgallium). The driver is a system library built without TSan, so TSan sees
# only its pthread calls and not the synchronization around them.
race:libgallium
